# 04b-repeated-dockerhub-push: Docker Hub: build the game server images and push them
# Copy to step.env (git-ignored) and fill in. One value per line, comments on their own line.
#
# Do by hand first:
#   - 04a-dockerhub-repos done (the repos exist)
#   - Docker Desktop running

# your Docker Hub user: the images are <user>/rising2-...
# Looks like: your Docker ID: 4-30 lowercase letters/digits (the name in docker login -u)
DOCKERHUB_USER=

# a Docker Hub personal access token with Read & Write (the one that works with docker login)
# Looks like: dckr_pat_ + ~27 characters (Docker Hub > Account settings > Personal access tokens, Read & Write)
DOCKERHUB_TOKEN=

# How long to wait for the provider before giving up (minutes, optional).
# WAIT_MIN=30
